<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CNA Gallo still assessing restructuring.</title>
<headline>CNA Gallo still assessing restructuring.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African retail and entertainment group CNA Gallo Ltd said on Wednesday it was still assessing a restructuring of the group.</p>
<p>CNA first announced the investigation in May which it said it hoped would enable it to more effectively capitalise on growth opportunities for its entertainment businesses.</p>
<p>The company urged shareholders to continue to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
